  "Header": "ヘッダー",
  "[HOST_COMPANY]\n[HOST_ADDRESS]\nTel: [CONTACT_PHONE] | Email: [CONTACT_EMAIL]\n\n[DATE]\n\nDear [GUEST_NAME],\n\nRe: Invitation to Visit [HOST_COMPANY] in [CITY], China\n\nIt is our pleasure to invite you to visit [HOST_COMPANY] from [START_DATE] to [END_DATE].": "[HOST_COMPANY]\n[HOST_ADDRESS]\n電話番号：[CONTACT_PHONE] | メール：[CONTACT_EMAIL]\n\n[DATE]\n\n[GUEST_NAME] 様\n\n中国 [CITY] の [HOST_COMPANY] へのご招待について\n\nこのたびは、[START_DATE] から [END_DATE] まで [HOST_COMPANY] にご訪問いただきたく、心よりご招待申し上げます。",
  "Visit Details": "訪問詳細",
  "Purpose of Visit: [PURPOSE]\nYour primary contact during the visit will be [CONTACT_NAME] at [HOST_COMPANY].\n\nPlease find the proposed itinerary below:\n[ITINERARY]": "訪問目的：[PURPOSE]\nご訪問中の主な連絡窓口は、[HOST_COMPANY] の [CONTACT_NAME] です。\n\n以下の予定 itinerary をご参照ください：\n[ITINERARY]",
  "We look forward to your visit and hope your time in [CITY] will be both productive and enjoyable.\n\nPlease confirm your availability by responding to [CONTACT_EMAIL].\n\nBest regards,\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\n[HOST_TITLE]\n[HOST_COMPANY]": "ご訪問を心待ちにしております。 [CITY] でのお時間が実り多く、楽しいものとなりますよう願っております。\n\nご都合をお知らせいただき、[CONTACT_EMAIL] までご返信ください。\n\n敬具\n[HOST_SIGNATURE]\n[HOST_TITLE]\n[HOST_COMPANY]",
